OL,7,FA mother whose daughter was shot dead
OL,8,Fby her father in Texas in what an
OL,9,Finquest later ruled was an unlawful
OL,10,Fkilling said she still "has a job to
OL,11,Fdo" in her fight to have the case
OL,12,Freopened.
OL,14,FJane Coates travelled to Collin County
OL,15,Fin the US state to call on the district
OL,16,Fattorney to reinstate the investigation
OL,17,Finto her daughter's death.
OL,19,FLucy Harrison, 23, from Warrington,
OL,20,FCheshire, was shot in the chest on 10
OL,21,FJanuary 2025 in Prosper, near Dallas.
